<title>VENEZUELA: Vencemos 9-mo net rises 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Vencemos 9-mo net rises 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net sales 112.15 billion bolivars vs 94.47 billion</p>
<p>Cost of sales 60.68 billion bolivars vs 49.62 billion</p>
<p>Operational costs 9.82 billion bolivars vs 13.16 billion</p>
<p>Net profit 35.37 billion bolivars versus 21.87 billion</p>
<p>Notes: Results expressed in constant September 30, 1996, bolivars.</p>
<p>Periods ended September 30.</p>
<p>Vencemos Corporacion SA is a cement-producing subsidiary of Mexican cement group Cemex.</p>
<p>-- Caracas Newsroom 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
